  "combinedDefaultCompositionWinRate": 0.595,
  "notes": "v1.3.0: Simple Outside, Deep Inside. Minimal black-and-white cards + high-dimension numerical kernel + AI-vs-AI auto spectate + free-creation sandbox. Default 1v1 with both sides controlled by one canonical utility AI (pause/step/speed/restart). Generator v3 composes 2-6 variable Actions (attack is just one Action), keeps deterministic seeds, mechanic fingerprints and v1/v2 explicit legacy reproduction; rare/level budget scales monotonically across the 12 rarity tiers. No economy, levels, gacha or unlocks. Legacy v2 composition/pressure/sustain repair stays only on the explicit v2 path."
}
